+## Disputes 
 
 Users must authenticate payments with their Apple Pay accounts, helping to reduce the risk of fraud or unrecognized payments. However, users can still dispute transactions after they complete payment. You can submit evidence to contest a dispute directly. The dispute process is the same as that for card payments. Learn about how to [manage disputes](https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding.md).
 
